# With no artifact, enchantment or token to sacrifice (Bot1 controls only a Mountain), the attempted bargain rolls back,
# then the spell is cast unbargained: 2 damage, no scry. It kills Llanowar Elves, which is
# exiled instead of dying (CR 614.1a). The positive control for bargain is the bargained scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Torch the Tower
Mountain x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Torch the Tower.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Modes(Bargain:)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot1.Hand.Torch the Tower.Colors = Red
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Toughness = 1
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Torch the Tower.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Modes(Cast without bargain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Torch the Tower
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
